      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Reproduced here using Open-Beta build 1548. Using an RTX 3060, driver version 566.03. CPU is AMD 5800X. Windows 10 Pro 22H2, OS Build 19045.5131.\n\nHow to reproduce: Change VRChat to Open-Beta in steam. Start VRChat and ensure you're on build 1548 or 1549. Set the graphics preset set to Medium. Exit and re-open VRChat. Change the graphics preset to High. Change into the test avatar that OP linked. Look in the mirror or camera. The textures on the entire dress become blurrier.\n\nIt doesn't seem to matter if you're in VR or Desktop mode. Considering the diversity of voters systems, the system specs doesn't seem to matter too.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
