  "details": "This started at least in build 1548.\n\nSteps to replicate:\n\n1. Open VRChat graphics settings\n\n2. Change to a lower or higher preset.\n\nSome avatar textures will become extremely blurry when changing the graphics preset to a higher or lower preset. No other graphics settings cause this. I have not found this to be affecting world textures.\n\nChanging back to the original preset the game was launched with will fix the blurriness, but you cannot use another preset properly unless you fully restart the game, as the issue persists when changing/rejoining worlds.\n\nTested GPU: NVIDIA RTX 2070 Super\n\nTested driver versions: 566.03, 566.14\n\nI also had a friend replicate this with an NVIDIA RTX 3080 Ti.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/AbZyBMAyH2E\n\nFor easy replication, here is a public avatar where the effects can be seen. The blue on the dress should become blurry.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_103cda43-a2f7-47d0-831a-84fc8c5e9a79",
